{
  "schema_version": "1.0",
  "encounter_id": "00043",
  "segments": [
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0001",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 1.04,
      "end_seconds": 6.01,
      "duration_seconds": 4.97,
      "text": "Good afternoon, doctor, the receptionist said you'd see me now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0002",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 7.41,
      "end_seconds": 12.48,
      "duration_seconds": 5.07,
      "text": "Yes, come in, take a seat. What can I do for you today?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 13.26,
      "end_seconds": 20.13,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "It's burning when I pass urine, mostly. I kept putting it off, which I know isn't sensible."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 21.65,
      "end_seconds": 27.79,
      "duration_seconds": 6.14,
      "text": "Alright, how long has this been going on? These questions might sound routine, but they matter."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 29.06,
      "end_seconds": 34.99,
      "duration_seconds": 5.93,
      "text": "Probably three days. Yeah. I did try to ignore it for a while."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 35.37,
      "end_seconds": 38.46,
      "duration_seconds": 3.09,
      "text": "Is it constant, or does it come and go?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 39.83,
      "end_seconds": 42.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.96,
      "text": "It's once or twice a day."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 44.32,
      "end_seconds": 47.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "And what do you do to cope with it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 48.68,
      "end_seconds": 51.47,
      "duration_seconds": 2.79,
      "text": "It settles a little with drinking water."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 52.49,
      "end_seconds": 54.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.9,
      "text": "And how severe is it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 56.38,
      "end_seconds": 59.94,
      "duration_seconds": 3.56,
      "text": "A four out of ten, I suppose."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 60.83,
      "end_seconds": 63.32,
      "duration_seconds": 2.49,
      "text": "Does it come along with anything else?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 64.67,
      "end_seconds": 72.32,
      "duration_seconds": 7.65,
      "text": "Uh, you know, when it starts I tend to get cloudy, smelly urine as well."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 72.73,
      "end_seconds": 86.12,
      "duration_seconds": 13.39,
      "text": "It's quite normal to feel unsure at this point. People often expect an instant answer, but a good assessment usually has a few stages, and today is mainly about narrowing things down and making a sensible plan together."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 87.35,
      "end_seconds": 89.17,
      "duration_seconds": 1.82,
      "text": "That's reassuring to hear."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 90.43,
      "end_seconds": 94.95,
      "duration_seconds": 4.52,
      "text": "Let me check a few things. Any vomiting, similar episode recently or fever?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 96.39,
      "end_seconds": 100.88,
      "duration_seconds": 4.49,
      "text": "I haven't had vomiting, similar episode recently or fever, no."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 101.58,
      "end_seconds": 104.43,
      "duration_seconds": 2.85,
      "text": "Okay, is the room warm enough for you?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 104.76,
      "end_seconds": 107.07,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "It's, It's perfect, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 107.87,
      "end_seconds": 109.55,
      "duration_seconds": 1.68,
      "text": "Alright, do you drink alcohol?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 110.14,
      "end_seconds": 113.62,
      "duration_seconds": 3.48,
      "text": "I gave up drinking about three years ago."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 114.86,
      "end_seconds": 120.25,
      "duration_seconds": 5.39,
      "text": "Is there anyone at home who can help you out if you need it?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 121.73,
      "end_seconds": 134.2,
      "duration_seconds": 12.47,
      "text": "Okay, you know, so yes, there's family around most evenings, and they've been very good about checking in, although they do worry more than they need to."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 135.06,
      "end_seconds": 140.76,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "What about allergies, to medicines or foods or anything else? I'm asking so that we don't miss anything."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 141.11,
      "end_seconds": 144.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "Yes, eggs. I get stomach cramps."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.02,
      "end_seconds": 160.69,
      "duration_seconds": 15.67,
      "text": "What I'm doing here is putting together three things: what you tell me, what I find when I examine you, and what the tests show. None of those alone is enough, which is why we sometimes need to wait for results before being certain."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 161.82,
      "end_seconds": 164.17,
      "duration_seconds": 2.35,
      "text": "I appreciate you explaining that."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 165.75,
      "end_seconds": 171.7,
      "duration_seconds": 5.95,
      "text": "Any long-term health problems I should know about? Bear with me, I'm just building up the picture."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.87,
      "end_seconds": 186.39,
      "duration_seconds": 13.52,
      "text": "Okay, so I have diabetes, for about a year. I told myself I'd wait and see, and here I am. I thought it would sort itself out, but it hasn't."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 186.72,
      "end_seconds": 194.11,
      "duration_seconds": 7.39,
      "text": "Right, so that's your known diabetes. We'll keep that in mind today. Are you comfortable? Do you want some water?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 195.26,
      "end_seconds": 198.83,
      "duration_seconds": 3.57,
      "text": "Yes, some water would be nice, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 199.61,
      "end_seconds": 201.79,
      "duration_seconds": 2.18,
      "text": "Does anything run in the family?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 202.7,
      "end_seconds": 204.42,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 204.75,
      "end_seconds": 207.15,
      "duration_seconds": 2.4,
      "text": "Are you on any tablets or medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 208.04,
      "end_seconds": 223.53,
      "duration_seconds": 15.49,
      "text": "I take glimepiride, 2 milligrams, before breakfast for my sugar. I, I take cranberry juice, every day. I just want to get back to normal, really. A neighbour of mine said I should see someone about it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "NURSE",
      "start_seconds": 224.55,
      "end_seconds": 232.91,
      "duration_seconds": 8.36,
      "text": "Here are the numbers, doctor. Respiratory rate 16, blood pressure 115 over 68, temp 36.6 degrees. Pulse is 75 beats a minute."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.01,
      "end_seconds": 237.99,
      "duration_seconds": 3.98,
      "text": "Good, thank you. Has anything about your daily routine changed lately?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 241.45,
      "end_seconds": 258.69,
      "duration_seconds": 17.24,
      "text": "Not really, the days are pretty much the same, work and home, and I've been trying to fit appointments in around my schedule, which isn't always easy, so I'm glad we could find a time today."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 260.75,
      "end_seconds": 263.68,
      "duration_seconds": 2.93,
      "text": "I'll examine you now, so please bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 264.5,
      "end_seconds": 266.39,
      "duration_seconds": 1.89,
      "text": "Yes, you know, doctor."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 267.84,
      "end_seconds": 271.38,
      "duration_seconds": 3.54,
      "text": "A little pressure here, tell me if it's tender."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 278.86,
      "end_seconds": 282.98,
      "duration_seconds": 4.12,
      "text": "There's mild tenderness above the pubic bone, and no tenderness in the loins."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 288.54,
      "end_seconds": 302.35,
      "duration_seconds": 13.81,
      "text": "All done, thank you, please sit down. Good, that's all I need to examine. Let me gather my thoughts and then we'll talk it through together. Just to be sure I've got this right, the glimepiride, what dose was that again?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 302.69,
      "end_seconds": 303.98,
      "duration_seconds": 1.29,
      "text": "2 milligrams. Yes."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 305.07,
      "end_seconds": 317.72,
      "duration_seconds": 12.65,
      "text": "Putting it all together, my working impression is a urinary tract infection. I want to be honest that this is an impression, not a final answer. I can't rule out a kidney infection yet."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 318.6,
      "end_seconds": 321.34,
      "duration_seconds": 2.74,
      "text": "Doctor, uh, is this dangerous?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0047",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 322.43,
      "end_seconds": 340.26,
      "duration_seconds": 17.83,
      "text": "I understand the worry. At the moment I'd say it's a urinary tract infection, and we'll know more once the a urine culture is back. Let me just recap so I've got it right. You've had burning when you pass urine for three days, and no fever or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0048",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 341.22,
      "end_seconds": 343.31,
      "duration_seconds": 2.09,
      "text": "Yes, you've got it."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0049",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 343.64,
      "end_seconds": 347.23,
      "duration_seconds": 3.59,
      "text": "Sorry, I'm just writing a few notes, bear with me."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0050",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 347.68,
      "end_seconds": 351.33,
      "duration_seconds": 3.65,
      "text": "Okay, so no problem, take your time."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0051",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 352.35,
      "end_seconds": 364.42,
      "duration_seconds": 12.07,
      "text": "I'm going to order a urine culture, for urinary symptoms. It's a routine test and it'll give us a much clearer picture. We should do a urine test for urinary symptoms."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0052",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 365.93,
      "end_seconds": 369.4,
      "duration_seconds": 3.47,
      "text": "Hmm, alright. When can I do that?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0053",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 370.62,
      "end_seconds": 392.45,
      "duration_seconds": 21.83,
      "text": "I'm prescribing nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day, for five days. That should help with urine infection. Drink plenty of water and don't hold it in when you need to go. A short walk every day, even twenty minutes, will help more than you'd think. I want you to come back or go to emergency straight away if you get a fever, back pain or vomiting."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0054",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 393.03,
      "end_seconds": 394.99,
      "duration_seconds": 1.96,
      "text": "Got it, thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0055",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 396.48,
      "end_seconds": 403.35,
      "duration_seconds": 6.87,
      "text": "Let's review you in a week. I want to be sure we're on the same page. How would you describe the plan?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0056",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 404.2,
      "end_seconds": 412.25,
      "duration_seconds": 8.05,
      "text": "So, I take the nitrofurantoin, 100 milligrams, twice a day and come back in a week. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0057",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 413.21,
      "end_seconds": 418.0,
      "duration_seconds": 4.79,
      "text": "Yes, exactly right. Wonderful, I think that's it. Ask me anything before you go."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0058",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 418.57,
      "end_seconds": 420.29,
      "duration_seconds": 1.72,
      "text": "No questions. Thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0059",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 421.07,
      "end_seconds": 421.77,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "Take care."
    }
  ]
}